# The password screen ($84:AD50) taking a correct password: the cursor's
# portrait stepped down (DOWN, wrapping from 0 to 5) and up (UP, wrapping
# from 5 back to 0), the slot stepped left and back right, then the first
# password of the table at $80:FDD5 entered (as 02_passwords.box enters
# it) and checked with START: the match ($84:AE45) and the start of its
# level ($84:AEFD). password.box enters only a wrong one; the state
# recipes that enter right ones are not traced. Then the same with the
# debug flag $0009 set before START (the counts set at $84:AF02 instead),
# which only a development build sets. Last, the seventh password (as
# 02_passwords.box enters it), whose level part 7 starts its own way
# ($84:AF44).
load build/aladdin/states/title.state
press DOWN
wait 30
press START
wait 150
press DOWN
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press LEFT
wait 8
press RIGHT
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press RIGHT
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press RIGHT
wait 8
press RIGHT
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press START
wait 600
press START
wait 300
load build/aladdin/states/title.state
