wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press RIGHT
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press RIGHT
wait 8
press RIGHT
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
poke $000009 01
press START
wait 600
